godotengine/godot/pulls/109737","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109737.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-20T15:54:57Z"},"body":"\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/63016\r\n\r\nBased on @Calinou work on branch https://github.com/godotengine/godot/compare/master...Calinou:godot:lightmapgi-directional-draw-direct-specular-lobes and https://media.contentapi.ea.com/content/dam/eacom/frostbite/files/gdc2018-precomputedgiobalilluminationinfrostbite.pdf\r\n\r\nReal Time (This PR and Master)\r\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"866\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-18 11-07-22\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3149b043-ef1d-453d-a4a4-cb0bbe53a1ec\" />\r\n\r\nNo directional (This PR and Master)\r\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"866\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-18 11-08-28\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/188be4af-e844-4593-b1a1-cc9af192b4cc\" />\r\n\r\nDirectional (Master)\r\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"866\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-18 11-12-00\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90f009de-b549-4941-9df9-41f5c927bd7a\" />\r\n\r\nDirectional (This PR)\r\n<img width=\"1500\" height=\"866\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-18 11-10-09\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/836c2dc5-1775-41c8-a109-cc39f8d028ca\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n- [x] Implement in Compatibility and Mobile\r\n- [x] Benchmark\r\n- [x] Function to compute only specular?\r\n\r\nI will appreciate feedback to improve this\r\n\r\nEdit for Function to compute specular:\r\nA lighter function doesn't seems to improve the performance\r\n\r\nEdit for Benchmark:\r\n\r\nMaster:\r\n```\r\nProject FPS: 352 (2.84 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 352 (2.84 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 350 (2.85 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 351 (2.84 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 352 (2.84 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 352 (2.84 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 352 (2.84 mspf)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n```\r\nProject FPS: 343 (2.91 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 343 (2.91 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 342 (2.92 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 343 (2.91 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 344 (2.90 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 343 (2.91 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 343 (2.91 mspf)\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n| No Specular | Specular |\r\n|--------|--------|\r\n| <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-47-53\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/12e3d41a-eac0-4478-8025-6d202e0345a9\" /> |  <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-47-50\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8f64e3b-e61e-4e0a-b79f-d7f5c0a86c9f\" />|\r\n|  <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-48-11\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/656a9ed5-f288-47ab-93a4-003a8ff0d81e\" /> |  <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-48-08\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18010054-68a5-4d50-8c18-263656191b9f\" /> |\r\n|  <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-48-53\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57892af5-4af5-4ee7-bc37-0906ce70dd49\" /> | <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-48-50\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7b6fa9c0-97a4-4f4d-bf04-40b7912ea240\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-49-14\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38556e4a-ec59-4012-aa32-d3b508898000\" /> | <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-49-08\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9002a1c-9857-475c-b582-73bfbaa63d4c\" /> |\r\n| <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-58-12\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3803e6bd-0bba-4cff-acd6-365dd787adc9\" /> | <img width=\"1458\" height=\"864\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2025-08-27 23-58-06\" src=\"https://github.com/us